# SEO crawl exports / audit dumps (business data — local only)
# Anchored to repo root — do not drop the leading slash, "SEO/" alone also
# matches docs/seo/ on case-insensitive filesystems (macOS/Windows) and
# silently hides that whole directory from git.
/SEO/

# SEO strategy/competitive docs (docs/seo/) — repo is public; content here
# (competitor traffic/backlink data, outreach drafts with real contacts,
# GEO/content priorities) stays local-only, never committed. See
# docs/seo/README.md (also local-only) for what lives here.
docs/seo/
.claude/settings.json
